{
  "slug": "heroui",
  "name": "HeroUI",
  "framework": "react",
  "version": "3.2.4",
  "repo": "heroui-inc/heroui",
  "license": {
    "github": "MIT",
    "npm": "MIT"
  },
  "theme": {
    "dark": true,
    "nativeIcons": false
  },
  "routes": [
    "/login",
    "/",
    "/orders",
    "/form",
    "/settings",
    "/components",
    "/landing",
    "/chat"
  ],
  "externals": {
    "chart": "recharts",
    "markdown": "react-markdown + remark-gfm"
  },
  "notes": "HeroUI v3 (@heroui/react + @heroui/styles) 官方默认主题，按 quick-start 顺序 @import tailwindcss → @heroui/styles，不写自定义配色 token。暗色：?theme=dark 在 <html> 加 .dark（HeroUI 官方约定），未指定时跟随 prefers-color-scheme。图标：HeroUI 不附带图标库（文档示例用第三方图标），nativeIcons=false，默认 lucide，?icon= / ?icons= 通过 @ui-gallery/icons-react 切换 lucide/tabler/phosphor/heroicons。字体：仅仓库自托管 OFL 字体（Geist 默认 / Inter / Noto Sans SC / LXGW WenKai Screen）。composed：Navbar/Sidebar/Steps/Timeline/Statistic/Descriptions/AvatarGroup/Grid/Stack/Layout/Container/AspectRatio/Anchor/Affix/BackTop/FloatButton/Code/Image/Carousel/Result/Popconfirm/Notification/MultiSelect/Cascader/Transfer/Rating/Upload/CommandPalette/DataGrid/ThemeProvider 用 HeroUI 原生组件 + Tailwind 工具类组合。missing：Mention/Tree/QRCode/Resizable/Watermark/Tour 无对应组件，不做模拟。已启用路由级代码分割，recharts 与 markdown 依赖拆分为独立 chunk；本地 build 的主 JS chunk 为 221.87 kB（gzip 70.14 kB）。",
  "coverage": {
